  <section><para dir="ltr"><span>Which of the following equations can be found by adding the equations in the system of equations shown?</span></para>
<para dir="ltr">     <span>\(\left\{\begin{array}{l}3x\;+\;5y\;=\;–9\\–3x\;–\;7y\;=\;–21\end{array}\right.\)</span></para></section>
